290
00:19:43,767 --> 00:19:47,646
- l 'm more than saying . - Maybe you should talk to your daughter .

291
00:19:48,272 --> 00:19:52,484
One more crack like that and you 're both through . Finito . Do you understand ?

292
00:19:52,651 --> 00:19:55,737
- ls that yours ? - l threw it out. lt 's too small .

293
