- You can 't encourage that retard . - Like I would . He 's disgusting .

294
00:20:00,826 --> 00:20:04,830
I 've got 1 2 crates arriving at the Portland docks tonight I need picked up .

295
00:20:05,372 --> 00:20:06,874
Antiques .

296
