302
00:21:34,461 --> 00:21:37,381
Graffiti is a condemnation of architecture .

303
00:21:37,548 --> 00:21:43,011
Kids create on top of buildings because they don 't see the expression within .

304
00:21:43,220 --> 00:21:45,264
