337
00:23:18,273 --> 00:23:22,110
I might argue your work is antagonistic when it needn 't be

338
00:23:22,319 --> 00:23:28,742
emotionally detached and lacking a moral center .

339
00:23:30,827 --> 00:23:33,622
If that 's the way you speak with your English class

340
