370
00:28:25,998 --> 00:28:27,583
Floyd .

371
00:28:27,749 --> 00:28:31,086
- You set up my computer . - Relax. I don 't know your business .

372
00:28:31,295 --> 00:28:34,548
I don 't want to . What ? You have nothing to worry about .

373
00:28:34,715 --> 00:28:39,136
- Nothing 's wrong with surfing The Barnyard . - You son of a bitch !

374
00:28:40,470 --> 00:28:43,849
Yeah , I bet you felt real sorry for that dog .

375
00:28:44,016 --> 00:28:45,601
I can 't believe you !

376
00:28:50,772 --> 00:28:52,482
You could get that .

377
00:28:52,900 --> 00:28:54,610
- Hello . - Mrs . Petrie .

378
00:28:54,818 --> 00:28:57,988
Hi , I 'm Marjorie Glick . We 've never met .

379
