397
00:30:31,290 --> 00:30:34,793
Hey , you gonna give us a hand here , Hubie Jr . ?

398
00:30:39,256 --> 00:30:42,843
Crockett 's paying us 1 00 bucks to deliver this crate .

399
00:30:43,010 --> 00:30:45,095
If I said to you , Mike

400
00:30:45,262 --> 00:30:47,264
