405
00:31:08,410 --> 00:31:10,662
This place used to keep me up at night .

406
00:31:13,790 --> 00:31:16,460
As a kid , I could see it from my bedroom window .

407
00:31:16,835 --> 00:31:20,297
I wouldn 't be able to sleep unless my mother pulled the shade .

408
00:31:21,173 --> 00:31:22,925
Where are you going ?

409
00:31:23,383 --> 00:31:25,677
I wanna see Hubie 's bedroom .

410
00:31:27,304 --> 00:31:29,598
And the bathroom where Birdie ... .

411
00:31:34,394 --> 00:31:35,854
Straker ?

412
00:31:46,532 --> 00:31:47,950
