419
00:32:51,388 --> 00:32:52,973
Just spread out .

420
00:32:53,140 --> 00:32:55,851
No sign of the Glick boy .

421
00:32:57,686 --> 00:32:59,813
- -find evidence of the boy .

422
00:33:10,073 --> 00:33:13,952
Mark , what were you boys doing on this side of town ?

423
00:33:14,536 --> 00:33:17,748
We were just playing flashlight tag .

424
00:33:18,332 --> 00:33:21,919
Charlie Rhodes lives just over the hill . Did you hear about his dog ?

425
00:33:22,419 --> 00:33:24,129
Yeah , I heard it died .

426
00:33:24,296 --> 00:33:28,967
Mrs. Glick says you and her boys had some trouble with Charlie on the school bus .

427
00:33:29,134 --> 00:33:32,638
You got him angry . Did you see Charlie last night ?

428
00:33:32,804 --> 00:33:34,181
No .

429
00:33:36,558 --> 00:33:38,894
Shut up , Cujo ! Quiet !

430
00:33:44,191 --> 00:33:45,234
Hi .

431
00:33:46,151 --> 00:33:48,820
Mr. Mears . Surprised to see you this morning .

432
00:33:48,987 --> 00:33:51,114
A child won 't last long in this cold .

433
00:33:51,281 --> 00:33:55,327
These Norton girls are angels , Ben . Before them it was Eva Prunier .

434
00:33:55,494 --> 00:33:59,206
You may not see it , but our landlady was the prettiest in the county .

435
00:33:59,373 --> 00:34:01,625
Eva 's still pretty. I can see it .

436
00:34:01,792 --> 00:34:03,836
What I see in Eva , it 's magic .

437
00:34:04,002 --> 00:34:07,798
Careful , Ed . Mr. Mears will turn your heartbreak into a bestseller .

438
00:34:07,965 --> 00:34:09,508
Our secrets are safe .

439
00:34:09,675 --> 00:34:12,094
Ben 's working on a piece of historical fiction .

440
00:34:12,302 --> 00:34:13,637
Yeah , I heard .

441
00:34:13,804 --> 00:34:15,973
- Marsten house ? - Who told you that ?

442
00:34:16,139 --> 00:34:17,641
Little bird in the library .

443
00:34:17,975 --> 00:34:21,270
What was it like in the house ? Tell us about when you found her .

444
00:34:21,478 --> 00:34:23,522
You 'll have to wait for the book .

445
00:34:23,689 --> 00:34:25,607
Come on . Give us a preview .

446
00:34:27,317 --> 00:34:31,446
I was 9 years old , living out on Burns Road with my aunt , Cynthia .

447
00:34:31,613 --> 00:34:34,283
I went in on a dare from the Bloody Pirates .

448
00:34:34,449 --> 00:34:37,911
Was Hubie already hanging , or did you see him do it ?

449
00:34:38,996 --> 00:34:40,289
I saw .

450
00:34:43,166 --> 00:34:47,212
I spent the whole night in there until a friend finally got my Aunt Cynthia .

451
00:34:47,754 --> 00:34:51,550
Terrible place , looking down on this town like a dark idol .

452
00:34:51,717 --> 00:34:55,179
- There 's a quote for the liner jacket . - We need some more water .

453
00:34:55,345 --> 00:34:56,763
Yeah , I 'll help .

454
00:34:56,930 --> 00:34:59,308
What about Ronnie Barnes ?

455
00:35:03,187 --> 00:35:04,396
Did you see him too ?

456
00:35:05,439 --> 00:35:06,815
No .

457
00:35:18,410 --> 00:35:20,370
No , I never did .

458
00:35:27,961 --> 00:35:29,254
I 'm so embarrassed .

459
00:35:29,421 --> 00:35:32,508
I know you didn 't want people to know what you 're writing .

460
00:35:32,674 --> 00:35:36,553
I went to the library. I mentioned your name to Loretta Starcher .

461
00:35:36,720 --> 00:35:39,348
Now the whole town knows . I was trying to help .

462
00:35:39,556 --> 00:35:42,309
- lt 's okay . - l was researching the Marsten 's for you .

463
00:35:42,476 --> 00:35:44,311
I wanted it to be a nice surprise .

464
00:35:44,478 --> 00:35:46,563
- Are you mad ? I would be . - Ben Mears .

465
00:35:46,730 --> 00:35:49,399
Didn 't mean to interrupt . May I speak with you ?

466
00:35:50,067 --> 00:35:51,360
I 'll call you .

467
00:35:51,527 --> 00:35:53,987
I know you 're on to something with this book .

468
00:35:56,573 --> 00:36:00,452
- Never thought we 'd see you again . - lt 's nice to see you too , chief .

469
00:36:01,370 --> 00:36:03,288
