473
00:36:12,130 --> 00:36:14,174
Did you see any children on your drive ?

474
00:36:14,383 --> 00:36:16,552
- Any flashlights in the woods ? - No .

475
00:36:16,760 --> 00:36:19,721
Anything unusual ? Maybe a van parked alongside the road ?

476
00:36:19,930 --> 00:36:21,223
No .

477
00:36:21,765 --> 00:36:24,601
All right. I do appreciate your help today .

478
00:36:25,102 --> 00:36:28,856
That dog in the cemetery , who found it first ?

479
00:36:29,773 --> 00:36:30,983
I did .

480
00:36:31,358 --> 00:36:32,651
Okay .

481
00:36:38,782 --> 00:36:41,410
Floyd , everything work out last night ?

482
00:36:41,994 --> 00:36:43,954
